WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.816
Use this slide as practice Work in small steps
predict the result and explain

00:00:05.829 --> 00:00:11.775
why your result makes sense Intermediate return a
sum Use a returned

00:00:11.802 --> 00:00:17.844
value Before running the code predict the output Run

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:22.475
the example in the browser inspect the result then
change one input or value and

00:00:22.502 --> 00:00:27.541
run it again Focus on what changed and why rather
than reading the code character

00:00:27.567 --> 00:00:28.370
by character
